yers swing around a massive metropolis, blasting each other with bullets and missles to become the champion. Play Free-For-All battles against other Webshooters, or try to take down thieving criminals flying around in helicopters! \n \nPROJECT STATUS\nOur game is currently in a prototype stage, despite that it's a blast and shaping up to be one of the most exciting VR mutliplayer games on the market. We'll be releasing a demo soon, so wishlist this page, so you don't miss it!", "short_description": "It started with a question, \"what if Spiderman had a gun?\". Now, Webshooters is an explosive multiplayer shooter that's pushing the limits of VR combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.enemyteam.games/webshooters-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Enemy Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.enemyteam.games/webshooters", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "885093746636770"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "7170406973074827", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "291725096593189", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "p